"suspension of practice" means voluntary suspension of practice as an Advocate or suspension by the Bar Council for
misconduct;
(o)
"Vakalatnama" means a Vakalatnama, memorandum of appearance or by any other document by which an Advocate or
any other legal practitioner is empowered to appear and plead before any Court, tribunal, authority or person.
